SUMMARY:The Forbidden Questions Social: A Non-Networking Experiment
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nHey Nomads! We hope everyone is absolutely
  crushing it socially\, professionally\, and personally this summer season
 .\nLet's be completely honest for a moment. Do any of you feel like you ar
 e asking and answering the exact same autopilot questions every single tim
 e you go out to meet new people? We feel the same way. Traditional\, rigid
  business networking is exhausted\, and we want to build actual community.
 \n\nSo for this social\, we have a challenge for you. For one night only\,
  your task will be to ask any question you want\, except for the three lis
 ted below.\n\n**The Forbidden Questions**\n\n1. What do you do?\n2. Where 
 are you from?\n3. How long have you lived in Asheville?\n\n**The Stakes:**
  Just for fun\, if anyone is caught asking one of these questions (or a sn
 eaky variation)\, the person who asked it has to buy a drink for the one w
 ho called them out!\n\nWill you accept the challenge? Let's see how creati
 ve we can get when we push past the usual scripts.\n\n**The Details**\nWe 
 look forward to another great night with you\, this time at Sweeten Creek 
 Brewing. Bring some of your friends or bring your dog or both!\nWhen you a
 rrive\, look for our ADN Signage and a group of fun\, welcoming faces. Fil
 l out a name tag to help ease introductions\, and start mingling and conne
 cting.\n\n**Parking and Dogs**\nThere is parking on Site in front of the b
 rewery and beyond. If those lots are full\, you may park anywhere on the h
 ill to the left of the brewery. The folks at Sweeten Creek Brewery also ha
 ve a deal with the company that owns the lot across sweeten creek from the
  brewery where you may also park\, just be careful crossing the busy stree
 t.\n\nThis brewery also has a wonderful dog park on site with water bowls 
 and water available. So bring your furry friends along for a fun evening o
 f connecting with great people.\n\n**ADN Pirani Cups available**\nCelebrat
 e our 5th anniversary with our customized [ADN Pirani cups](https://avldig
 italnomads.org/meet-our-brand-new-customized-adn-pirani-mugs/)! Available 
 in 16oz\, 26oz\, and 32oz sizes\, you can purchase yours directly at this 
 event.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/avl-digital-nomads/events/315270176/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260615T141749Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260615T141749Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
