SUMMARY:AI Hacks & Hops: Taking Agentic AI to the next level with Hermes
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**Taking Agentic AI to the next level with
  Hermes**\n**Speaker:** [Jared Lucas](https://www.linkedin.com/in/jaredclu
 cas/)\n\n**Description:**\nIf you’ve used Claude Cowork\, you already kn
 ow how useful an AI collaborator can be inside a project. This session sho
 ws what comes next: Hermes as a broader agent operating system\, where age
 nts can use tools\, share memory\, run scheduled work\, coordinate through
  Kanban\, and take on real workflows beyond a single chat window. We’ll 
 cover the basic concepts and show practical examples of what becomes possi
 ble.\n\n**General Event Info**\nAI Hacks and Hops is a monthly event tailo
 red for non-technical professionals\, entrepreneurs\, marketers\, engineer
 s\, or anyone who wants to explore and discuss how to use AI.\n\nEach gath
 ering will feature presentations\, stimulating group discussions\, and a r
 elaxed atmosphere for enjoying your favorite brews while delving into the 
 world of AI. Topics will range from AI integration in business processes\,
  marketing\, content creation\, software\, ethical considerations\, human-
 AI collaboration strategies\, to the latest advancements in AI technology.
  The informal setting encourages open dialogue\, idea exchange\, and foste
 rs a collaborative spirit.
